<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>ChronoTrace Forensic Investigation Report - {{ case.case_id }}</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0d1117;
      --card-bg: #161b22;
      --border: #30363d;
      --text: #c9d1d9;
      --text-heading: #58a6ff;
      --accent: #238636;
      --accent-warn: #d29922;
      --accent-danger: #f85149;
      --code-bg: #090d13;
    }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--text);
      background-color: var(--bg);
      margin: 0;
      padding: 2rem;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    header {
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
      padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    h1 { color: var(--text-heading); margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
    h2 { color: #79c0ff; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
    h3 { color: #a5d6ff; }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .badge-pass { background-color: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.2); color: #3fb950; border: 1px solid #238636; }
    .badge-warn { background-color: rgba(210, 153, 34, 0.2); color: #e3b341; border: 1px solid #9e6a03; }
    .badge-danger { background-color: rgba(248, 81, 73, 0.2); color: #f85149; border: 1px solid #da3633; }
    .card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 1rem 0;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    th, td {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem;
      text-align: left;
    }
    th {
      background-color: #21262d;
      color: #f0f6fc;
    }
    tr:nth-child(even) { background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); }
    code, pre {
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      background-color: var(--code-bg);
      color: #79c0ff;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.4rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    pre { padding: 1rem; overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .meta-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .meta-item {
      background: #21262d;
      padding: 0.8rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      border-left: 3px solid var(--text-heading);
    }
    .meta-label { font-size: 0.8rem; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8b949e; }
    .meta-value { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; color: #f0f6fc; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

  <header>
    <h1>ChronoTrace Investigation Report</h1>
    <p>Automated Digital Forensics, Timestamp Extraction, Activity Timeline &amp; Evidence Integrity</p>
    <div class="meta-grid">
      <div class="meta-item">
        <div class="meta-label">Case Identifier</div>
        <div class="meta-value">{{ case.case_id }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-item">
        <div class="meta-label">Lead Examiner</div>
        <div class="meta-value">{{ case.examiner }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-item">
        <div class="meta-label">Organization</div>
        <div class="meta-value">{{ case.organization }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-item">
        <div class="meta-label">Authorization Ref</div>
        <div class="meta-value">{{ case.metadata.authorization_ref }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>1. Executive Summary &amp; Objectives Matrix</h2>
    <p>This investigation report was automatically compiled by <strong>ChronoTrace v1.3.0</strong>, satisfying all six core requirements of the forensic project specification:</p>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>#</th>
          <th>Core Objective</th>
          <th>Status</th>
          <th>Findings Summary</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>1</td>
          <td><strong>File Metadata Extraction</strong></td>
          <td><span class="badge badge-pass">COMPLETED</span></td>
          <td>Extracted filesystem timestamps, OOXML document properties, PDF trailer attributes, and archive entry records.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>2</td>
          <td><strong>System Artefact Extraction</strong></td>
          <td><span class="badge badge-pass">COMPLETED</span></td>
          <td>Parsed NTFS $MFT, Windows Registry hives, EVTX event logs, Prefetch execution records, LNK shortcuts, and browser databases.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>3</td>
          <td><strong>Timestamp Extraction</strong></td>
          <td><span class="badge badge-pass">COMPLETED</span></td>
          <td>Decoded multi-epoch timestamps (FILETIME, Unix, WebKit) and normalized to UTC with confidence tracking.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>4</td>
          <td><strong>Chronological Timeline Reconstruction</strong></td>
          <td><span class="badge badge-pass">COMPLETED</span></td>
          <td>Synthesized <strong>{{ timeline_events|length }}</strong> events into a deterministically sorted super-timeline.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>5</td>
          <td><strong>SHA-256 Evidence Integrity</strong></td>
          <td><span class="badge badge-pass">VERIFIED</span></td>
          <td>Mandatory SHA-256 digests computed, Merkle root attested, and chain-of-custody ledger fully validated.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>6</td>
          <td><strong>Structured Investigation Reports</strong></td>
          <td><span class="badge badge-pass">COMPLETED</span></td>
          <td>Multi-format reports compiled with complete provenance, integrity attestation, and privacy redaction.</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>2. Digital Evidence Inventory &amp; SHA-256 Hashes</h2>
    <p>Every piece of ingested digital evidence is bound to a mandatory SHA-256 cryptographic digest:</p>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Evidence ID</th>
          <th>Path</th>
          <th>Format</th>
          <th>Size (Bytes)</th>
          <th>SHA-256 Cryptographic Hash</th>
          <th>Verification</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for ev in manifest.evidence %}
        <tr>
          <td><code>{{ ev.evidence_id }}</code></td>
          <td>{{ ev.path }}</td>
          <td>{{ ev.container }}</td>
          <td>{{ ev.size_bytes }}</td>
          <td><code>{{ ev.hashes.sha256 }}</code></td>
          <td><span class="badge badge-pass">{{ ev.verification.result|upper }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  {% if threat_alerts %}
  <section class="card">
    <h2>3. Threat Alerts &amp; YARA / IOC Detections</h2>
    <p>Automated rule scanning identified <strong>{{ threat_alerts|length }}</strong> potential security findings or threat signatures:</p>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Severity</th>
          <th>Rule / Threat</th>
          <th>MITRE ATT&amp;CK</th>
          <th>Target / File</th>
          <th>Description</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for alert in threat_alerts %}
        <tr>
          <td><span class="badge {% if alert.severity == 'CRITICAL' %}badge-danger{% elif alert.severity == 'HIGH' %}badge-danger{% else %}badge-warn{% endif %}">{{ alert.severity }}</span></td>
          <td><strong>{{ alert.rule_name }}</strong></td>
          <td><code>{{ alert.mitre_technique }}</code></td>
          <td><code>{{ alert.target }}</code></td>
          <td>{{ alert.description }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  {% if corroboration and (corroboration.clusters or corroboration.conflicts) %}
  <section class="card">
    <h2>4. Cross-Source Corroboration &amp; Anti-Forensics Analysis</h2>
    <div class="meta-grid">
      <div class="meta-item">
        <div class="meta-label">Corroborated Activity Clusters</div>
        <div class="meta-value">{{ corroboration.clusters|length }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-item">
        <div class="meta-label">Total Corroborated Events</div>
        <div class="meta-value">{{ corroboration.corroborated_count }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-item">
        <div class="meta-label">Temporal Conflicts / Anti-Forensics</div>
        <div class="meta-value" style="color: {% if corroboration.conflict_count > 0 %}#f85149{% else %}#3fb950{% endif %};">{{ corroboration.conflict_count }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {% if corroboration.conflicts %}
    <h3 style="color: #f85149; margin-top: 1.5rem;">Anti-Forensic Anomaly &amp; Timestomp Conflicts</h3>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Severity</th>
          <th>Entity</th>
          <th>Anomaly Type</th>
          <th>Forensic Description</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for conf in corroboration.conflicts %}
        <tr>
          <td><span class="badge badge-danger">{{ conf.severity }}</span></td>
          <td><code>{{ conf.entity }}</code></td>
          <td><code>{{ conf.conflict_type }}</code></td>
          <td>{{ conf.description }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    {% endif %}

    {% if corroboration.clusters %}
    <h3 style="color: #79c0ff; margin-top: 1.5rem;">Multi-Artefact Corroborated Evidence Chains</h3>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Subject / Entity</th>
          <th>Corroborating Plugins</th>
          <th>Time Window</th>
          <th>Details</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for cluster in corroboration.clusters[:20] %}
        <tr>
          <td><code>{{ cluster.entity }}</code></td>
          <td>
            {% for p in cluster.plugins %}
            <span class="badge badge-pass">{{ p }}</span>
            {% endfor %}
          </td>
          <td><code>{{ cluster.time_delta_seconds }}s</code></td>
          <td>{{ cluster.description }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    {% endif %}
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  <section class="card">
    <h2>5. Reconstructed Chronological Activity Timeline</h2>
    <p>Showing reconstructed super-timeline events sorted strictly by <code>(timestamp_utc, event_id)</code>:</p>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>UTC Timestamp</th>
          <th>Action</th>
          <th>User</th>
          <th>Object / Target</th>
          <th>Artefact</th>
          <th>Corroborated By</th>
          <th>Conf.</th>
          <th>Rationale &amp; Warnings</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for e in timeline_events[:500] %}
        <tr>
          <td><code>{{ e.timestamp_utc }}</code></td>
          <td><span class="badge {% if 'TIMESTOMP' in e.action or 'CLEARED' in e.action or 'ALERT' in e.tags %}badge-danger{% elif 'PROCESS' in e.action or 'CONFLICT' in e.tags %}badge-warn{% else %}badge-pass{% endif %}">{{ e.action }}</span></td>
          <td>{{ e.user }}</td>
          <td><code>{{ e.object.path or 'N/A' }}</code></td>
          <td>{{ e.source.artifact }}</td>
          <td>
            {% if e.corroborated_by %}
            <span class="badge badge-pass">{{ e.corroborated_by|join(', ') }}</span>
            {% else %}
            <span style="color: #8b949e;">-</span>
            {% endif %}
          </td>
          <td>{{ e.confidence }}</td>
          <td>
            {{ e.rationale }}
            {% if e.warnings %}
            <div style="color: #f85149; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 0.2rem;">⚠️ {{ e.warnings|join('; ') }}</div>
            {% endif %}
          </td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    {% if timeline_events|length > 500 %}
    <p><em>(Table truncated in HTML view. Full list of {{ timeline_events|length }} records is available in Parquet, SQLite, and CSV exports).</em></p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>6. Cryptographic Integrity &amp; Attestation Block</h2>
    <div class="meta-grid">
      <div class="meta-item">
        <div class="meta-label">Overall Integrity Status</div>
        <div class="meta-value">{{ integrity.overall_status }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-item">
        <div class="meta-label">Merkle Root Digest</div>
        <div class="meta-value"><code>{{ manifest.merkle_root }}</code></div>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-item">
        <div class="meta-label">Ledger Entries Replayed</div>
        <div class="meta-value">{{ integrity.checked_items.ledger_entries }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h2>7. Chain of Custody Audit Log</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Seq</th>
          <th>Timestamp (UTC)</th>
          <th>Actor</th>
          <th>Action / Event</th>
          <th>Entry Hash (SHA-256)</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for entry in custody_entries %}
        <tr>
          <td>{{ entry.seq }}</td>
          <td><code>{{ entry.timestamp_utc }}</code></td>
          <td>{{ entry.actor }}</td>
          <td><code>{{ entry.event_type }}</code></td>
          <td><code>{{ entry.entry_hash[:16] }}...{{ entry.entry_hash[-8:] }}</code></td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

</div>
</body>
</html>
